title: transition1
tags:
---
Is any of this even worth it?
I don't know who I am anymore.
I've been trying so hard to figure it all out.
But I can't.
Everyone else knows who they are.
Why don't I?
Why can't I grasp who I am?
I wish I knew.
It would make life so much easier.
I wish I had more time to figure it all out.
===
